## Workflow Summary

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    COMPLETE WORKFLOW                           │
├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ 1. Analyze codebase before starting                            │
│ 2. Review complete task requirements                           │
│ 3. For each task:                                              │
│    ├── Gather context first                                    │
│    ├── Build one small piece                                   │
│    ├── Verify immediately using commands                       │
│    └── Present results                                         │
│ 4. Review at strategic milestones                              │
│ 5. Integrate one connection at a time                          │
│ 6. Verify before git operations                                │
│ 7. Follow safe git workflow step-by-step                       │
│ 8. Use conversation history if recovery needed                 │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## Communication Protocol

When working on tasks:

| Stage | Action |
|-------|--------|
| **Before implementing** | Present context findings and proposed approach |
| **During implementation** | Show code as it is created |
| **After each piece** | Show verification results |
| **When errors occur** | Present analysis and wait for approval before fixing |
| **Before git operations** | Present file verification and wait for approval |
| **At milestones** | Summarize progress and confirm next steps |

---

> **Final Reminder:** Never assume. Always verify. Always communicate.